{
  "id": "hung-up-to-love-story",
  "title": "Hung Up to Love Story, 2005–2008",
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "anchor": {
        "segment": 0,
        "offset": 0.3
      },
      "kind": "intro",
      "text": "Madonna drew on seventies disco, ABBA and Giorgio Moroder for Hung Up. To sample ABBA's Gimme Gimme Gimme, she sent an emissary to Stockholm with a pleading letter.",
      "image": "artist-Q1744",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Hung Up (Wikipedia)",
          "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hung_Up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rihanna-arrives",
      "anchor": {
        "segment": 1,
        "offset": 2.1
      },
      "kind": "changeover",
      "text": "Rihanna's Umbrella now sings over Madonna's band. Tricky Stewart and The-Dream wrote it for Britney Spears, but her label passed. Its loop is the axis begun on four: four, one, five, six minor.",
      "image": "artist-Q36844",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Umbrella (song) (Wikipedia)",
          "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Umbrella_(song)"
        },
        {
          "title": "Rihanna, Umbrella (Hooktheory TheoryTab, chords)",
          "url": "https://www.hooktheory.com/theorytab/view/rihanna/umbrella"
        },
        {
          "title": "I–V–vi–IV progression (Wikipedia)",
          "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I%E2%80%93V%E2%80%93vi%E2%80%93IV_progression"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "swift-arrives",
      "anchor": {
        "segment": 3,
        "offset": 2.1
      },
      "kind": "changeover",
      "text": "Taylor Swift's Love Story now rides the Umbrella band. Swift wrote it on her bedroom floor in about twenty minutes.",
      "image": "artist-Q26876",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Love Story (Taylor Swift song) (Wikipedia)",
          "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love_Story_(Taylor_Swift_song)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outro",
      "anchor": {
        "segment": 4,
        "offset": 1.0
      },
      "kind": "outro",
      "text": "She gave Romeo and Juliet a happy ending. Her chords run the axis: one, five, six minor, four. Three hits, three years, one cycle.",
      "image": "artist-Q26876",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Love Story (Taylor Swift song) (Wikipedia)",
          "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love_Story_(Taylor_Swift_song)"
